MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,

you simply have to use local() for the variable you pass into the function:

f1 = function(df, yr, doy){

  browser()
  df %>% filter(year == yr, doy == local(doy))
}

Best
Max

